  "details": "Unfortunately, I don’t know what they are or how to correctly reproduce the issue, but I have some avatars uploaded that do have this issue: \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_547bd70e-a84c-46c7-85e3-6159a2c5c20d\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_833733fe-d076-4aca-9850-7e9876fcd4b7\n\nIn the quick menu, these avatars just make the majority of the menu blue whenever they’re being previewed. I don’t know what it looks like when others use it. \n\nI also attached a picture of my friend’s avatar, since it’s not public, but has this issue and shows what it looks like. \n\nMaybe it’s GoGoLoco or one of the avatar’s bounding boxes?",
